To buy shares of a country, we have to use the country's currency.
conversely, if the stock market deteriorates then the investors will move their funds to other countries that the growth prospects were good, so that the country's currency will weaken.
Cash flow will occur in countries that share price indices are weakening to the country is strengthening its stock price index.
If you buy the currency of a country that shares a good market prospect and sell the currency of a country which shares the deteriorating market conditions, then of course you will be able to reap the benefits.
