What Is OCPP & Why Is It Important To Electric Car Adoption?
The latest standard in the world of EV charging is OCPP. OCPP stands for Open Charge Point Protocol.
Before OCPP, charging networks (which typically control pricing, access, and session limits) were closed and did not allow for site hosts to change networks should they want different network features or pricing. Instead, they had to completely replace the hardware (the charging station) to get a different network.
