In fact, the damage that can be caused by the chemicals that are released by such e-waste into the eco-system can pose a very serious threat to our planet.
To save our planer from such e-waste, researchers have come out with the concept of recycling the waste.
Remember that the waste in electronic gadgets like your cell phones is not like regular trash.
