You can control your Android device if you have root access. In this post, we list 10 good reasons why you might want to have root access in your Android device.
Root specific apps can enhance your device without requiring your to install a custom ROM or flash a custom MOD. These apps allow you to preform actions that you normally would not be able to.
There are several apps out there that allow you to make backups of important data from your Android device. This includes backing up partitions like your EFS, IMEI and Modem.
